                          \n                            <button type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse252703\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse252703\">\n                            Do you use genuine parts for repairs?\n                            </button>\n                                 Yes, we use only high-quality, genuine parts to ensure the best performance and longevity of your device after the repair.                            \n                            <button type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse252704\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse252704\">\n                            Is there a warranty on your repairs?\n                            </button>\n                                 Absolutely. All our repairs come with a warranty to give you peace of mind. The specific warranty duration may vary depending on the type of repair and the device.                            \n                            <button type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse252705\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse252705\">\n                            How do I get a quote for my repair?\n                            </button>\n                                 You can get a quote by visiting our website or contacting our customer service. We provide transparent pricing with no hidden fees.                            \n				24 Hours &amp; Emergencies			\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g><path d=\"M37.844 38.832a10.153 10.153 0 0 0-1.122 3.592 15.14 15.14 0 0 1-15.145-15.146 10.256 10.256 0 0 0 3.592-1.12L14.886 15.874a6.086 6.086 0 0 0-1.892 2.713c-2.628 8.769.043 18.523 6.97 25.45a26.512 26.512 0 0 0 18.63 7.961 23.628 