 after the repair.                            \n                            <button type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse32504\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse32504\">\n                            Is there a warranty on your repairs?\n                            </button>\n                                Absolutely. All our repairs come with a warranty to give you peace of mind. The specific warranty duration may vary depending on the type of repair and the device.                            \n                            <button type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse32505\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse32505\">\n                            How do I get a quote for my repair?\n                            </button>\n                                You can get a quote by visiting our website or contacting our customer service. We provide transparent pricing with no hidden fees.                            \n				Latest Post<h2>Stay update with us</h2>			\n					<p>Qui culpa qui consequat officia cillum quis irure aliquip ut dolore sit eu culpa ut irure nisi occaecat dolore adipisicing do pariatur.</p>				\n                <a href=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/the-ultimate-ac-servicing-checklist-for-a-cool-home/\">\n                                            <img width=\"1000\" height=\"563\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/7028.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/7028.webp 1000w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/7028-300x169.webp 300w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/7028-768x432.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />                                    </a>\n                        <ul>\n	<li><a href=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/category/ac-repa