oolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-1-150x150.webp 150w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-1-300x300.webp 300w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-1-768x768.webp 768w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-1.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"190f1b2\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"10 (1)\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTM1OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3RoZW1ld2FudC5jb21cL3Byb2R1Y3RzXC93b3JkcHJlc3NcL2Nvb2xhaXJcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzA1XC8xMC0xLndlYnAiLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiIxOTBmMWIyIn0%3D\" href=\'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1.webp\'><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1-150x150.webp 150w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1-300x300.webp 300w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1-768x768.webp 768w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n					<h2>Powerful Cooling, Smart Savings – Comfort All Year Round!</h2>				\n		Experience unparalleled comfort and efficiency with our state-of-the-art Air Conditioning Unit. Engineered with the latest technology, our air conditioner ensures optimal cooling while maintaining energy efficiency. Perfect for both residential and commercial spaces, it offers a seamless blend of performance, durability, and sleek design.		\n					<h5>Choose Capacity</h5>				\n					<h3>1PK</h3>				\n					<h3>2PK</h3>				\n					<h3>3PK</h3>				\n					<h2>Features</h2>				\n					<figure><img width=\"256\" height=\"256\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/bulb.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Energy Saving</h4><p>Designed to consume minimal power, reducing your electricity bills without compromising performance.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/silence.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Quiet Operation</h4><p>Operates at a low noise level, ensuring a peaceful environment for work or rest.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/wifi.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Smart Wi-Fi</h4><p>Allows users to control the AC remotely using a smartphone app or voice assistants like Alexa.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/speedometer.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Turbo Cooling</h4><p>Instant cooling by operating the AC at maximum capacity for a short period, Cools the room quickly.</p>				\n															<img width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11.webp 1000w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11-300x300.webp 300w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11-150x150.webp 150w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />															\n					<h3>Stay cool and comfortable year-round with energy-efficient, smart air conditioning designed for ultimate performance, reliability, and effortless climate control.</h3>				\n					<h2>Specifications</h2>		