ntent/uploads/2024/05/10-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1-150x150.webp 150w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1-300x300.webp 300w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1-768x768.webp 768w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10-1.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n					<h2>Powerful Cooling, Smart Savings – Comfort All Year Round!</h2>				\n		Experience unparalleled comfort and efficiency with our state-of-the-art Air Conditioning Unit. Engineered with the latest technology, our air conditioner ensures optimal cooling while maintaining energy efficiency. Perfect for both residential and commercial spaces, it offers a seamless blend of performance, durability, and sleek design.		\n					<h5>Choose Capacity</h5>				\n					<h3>1PK</h3>				\n					<h3>2PK</h3>				\n					<h3>3PK</h3>				\n					<h2>Features</h2>				\n					<figure><img width=\"256\" height=\"256\" src=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/bulb.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Energy Saving</h4><p>Designed to consume minimal power, reducing your electricity bills without compromising performance.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/silence.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Quiet Operation</h4><p>Operates at a low noise level, ensuring a peaceful environment for work or rest.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/wifi.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Smart Wi-Fi</h4><p>Allows users to control the AC remotely using a smartphone app or voice assistants like Alexa.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/speedometer.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h4>Turbo Cooling</h4><p>Instant cooling by operating the AC at maximum capacity for a short period, Cools the room quickly.</p>				\n															<img width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11.webp 1000w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11-300x300.webp 300w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11-150x150.webp 150w, https://themewant.com/products/wordpress/coolair/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/11-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />															\n					<h3>Stay cool and comfortable year-round with energy-efficient, smart air conditioning designed for ultimate performance, reliability, and effortless climate control.</h3>				\n					<h2>Specifications</h2>				\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1650\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1650\" >\n					 Cooling Performance \n						</summary>\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Cooling Capacity: 18,000 BTU/h\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.20